      },
      "text": "In addition to targeting Georgian government and media Web sites, Russian hackers brought down the Russian newspaper Skandaly.ru, apparently for expressing some pro-Georgian sentiment.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
